{"id":"37a1eca3256ba068","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-zfc-ideal7-ideal-restriction.md","title":"ZFC Ideal7 Ideal Restriction","display":"df-zfc-ideal7-ideal-restriction — ZFC Ideal7 Ideal Restriction","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-ideal7-ideal-restriction","aliases":["58-df-zfc-ideal7-ideal-restriction"],"display":"df-zfc-ideal7-ideal-restriction — ZFC Ideal7 Ideal Restriction","depends_on":["[[58-df-ideal]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-ideal7-ideal-restriction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-ideal7-ideal-restriction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-ideal7-ideal-restriction — ZFC Ideal7 Ideal Restriction"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6e4f95381faac4f9\" href=\"?note=6e4f95381faac4f9\" title=\"58-df-ideal\">58-df-ideal</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y,\\mathcal I,\\mathcal J\\in V\">\\(X,Y,\\mathcal I,\\mathcal J\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ideal}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ideal}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6e4f95381faac4f9\" href=\"?note=6e4f95381faac4f9\" title=\"58-df-ideal\">58-df-ideal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcIdeal7IdealRestriction}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcIdeal7IdealRestriction}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal7\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}restriction}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcIdeal7IdealRestriction}_S(X,Y,\\mathcal I,\\mathcal J)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ideal}(\\mathcal I,\\mathcal P(X))\\land\nY\\subseteq X\\land\\mathcal J=\\mathcal I\\cap\\mathcal P(Y)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal7\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}restriction}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcIdeal7IdealRestriction}_S(X,Y,\\mathcal I,\\mathcal J)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ideal}(\\mathcal I,\\mathcal P(X))\\land\nY\\subseteq X\\land\\mathcal J=\\mathcal I\\cap\\mathcal P(Y)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The upstream ideal predicate takes its downward-closure carrier as the second argument, so an ideal on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> is correctly expressed over <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(X)\">\\(\\mathcal P(X)\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-ideal","status":"resolved","id":"6e4f95381faac4f9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ideal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ideal","status":"resolved","id":"6e4f95381faac4f9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ideal}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-ideal]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,Y,\\mathcal I,\\mathcal J\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ideal}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcIdeal7IdealRestriction}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal7\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}restriction}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcIdeal7IdealRestriction}_S(X,Y,\\mathcal I,\\mathcal J)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ideal}(\\mathcal I,\\mathcal P(X))\\land\nY\\subseteq X\\land\\mathcal J=\\mathcal I\\cap\\mathcal P(Y)","display":true},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P(X)","display":false}],"bytes":949,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2310","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-ideal7-ideal-restriction.md|58-df-zfc-ideal7-ideal-restriction]]（batch19）"}],"outgoing":["6e4f95381faac4f9"]}